Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:32.84,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\be1\t(0,316,\3c&HFDFDFD&\1c&HFDFDFD&)\pos(645,306)}Presenting Studio Khara's 1st Production
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:40.81,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs70\fscy170\1c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\bord0.2\be1\t(0,640,\3c&H20117A&\1c&H20117A&)\pos(640,260)}Rebuild of Evangelion: Prelude
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:12.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It shows up {\i1}now{\i0\fscx60} {\r}, of all times!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:13.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:21.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Due to the present state of emergency,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:24.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}all phone lines have been disabled.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:25.14,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:27.53,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,My cell phone has no signal,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.53,0:01:29.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,and the buses and trains are shut down too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.53,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnScott\fs56\be1\1c&H87785B&\frx8\fry4\frz31.762\pos(294,82)}Shinji
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.53,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnScott\fs56\be1\1c&H262724&\pos(1091,567)\frz30.172}Wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.53,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnScott\fs56\be1\1c&H262724&\pos(1093,629)\frz29.618}until I get there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.53,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnScott\fs56\be1\1c&H262724&\pos(1142,669)\frz30.61}'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.53,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnScott\fs56\be1\1c&H423517&\frx8\fry4\frz35.575\pos(468,481)}Feast your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.53,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnScott\fs56\be1\1c&H423517&\frx8\fry4\frz36.632\pos(491,528)}on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:35.53,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it'll be impossible to meet her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:40.16,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got no choice. I should head to a shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:16.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,All missiles have hit the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:37.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I made you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:57.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The target is still unharmed. It's continuing to advance towards Tokyo-3.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:03:00.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Air Force is unable to stop it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.59,0:03:04.26,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Throw everything at it! Have even the 4th Division open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:07.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Spare no expense! Destroy the target at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:31.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,How the hell?! We made direct hits!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:34.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The tank battalion was completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:37.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Missiles and artillery are useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.85,0:03:41.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's pointless! This type of firepower's not going to get us anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:43.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So, it has an AT Field after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:43.82,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:46.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Conventional weapons are useless against an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:53.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood. We'll deploy it according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:03:59.16,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No way... it can't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,They're going to use an N2 Mine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:22.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.69,0:04:26.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems you won't be needed this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:26.66,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,Shockwave incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:28.85,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:32.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... but I think I got some sand in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:34.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Great! Here, help me out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:36.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Get ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:38.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And PUSH!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:48.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks! Couldn't have done it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:51.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I should be thanking you, Katsuragi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:53.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Call me Misato, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:04:56.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice to meet you, Ikari Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:57.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.18,0:04:59.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What is the target's status?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:02.19,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,Due to radio interference, the target cannot be confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:02.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,With that explosion, it must be obliterated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:04.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Restoring visual.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:18.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And that was our trump card...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:21.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,How is this possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:23.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Goddamn monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:27.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank God my Renault still works!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:32.67,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be no joke for this car to die on me, since I've still got 12 payments left on the lease...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:35.30,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I called ahead to reserve an express train for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:37.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,so we might still make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:40.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Say, don't you have any questions for me, Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:42.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,N-no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:45.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been the only one talking here, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:49.47,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's nothing to apologize over,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:52.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,but I was sure you were going to ask "What was that giant thing?,"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,or maybe, "What's going on here?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:56.30,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,you know, those sorts of things?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:05:57.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:06:01.94,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't see the point, since I didn't think you'd give me an answer anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:04.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, you sure jump to wrong conclusions, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's something adults do, not teenagers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.67,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay. {I don't care.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:12.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just following my directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:16.56,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?... never mind then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.27,0:06:20.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Just for your information, that thing was a mysterious life form we call an "Angel."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:28.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The 4th Angel...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.61,0:06:31.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It possesses an astounding regenerative capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:34.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Complete by itself, it is a nearly-perfect living creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:35.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it can regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:38.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Because Angels partook of the Fruit of Life, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:43.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. They exist to exterminate us... we, who partook of the Fruit of Wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.78,0:06:47.13,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,The gate is closing. Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:50.47,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,"Secret Military Agency NERV"...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:53.43,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it's a private organization under the direct control of the U.N..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:55.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's where my father is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:56.95,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.95,0:06:58.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what your dad's job is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,"Work of utmost importance in the protection of humanity."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.44,0:07:06.98,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what my teacher said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:12.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,From here on, you will be in command of this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:14.56,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Show us what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:15.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:21.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari-kun, I have to admit that nothing in our arsenal is effective against the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:24.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So you claim you can defeat this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:27.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,NERV exists for that very purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:30.38,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Are we going to where my father is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:32.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I imagine he'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:38.02,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Father...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:43.47,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, did your father send you an ID card?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.35,0:07:45.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:48.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:49.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:50.86,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnBolide\be1\fs80\shad0\1c&H343436&\bord0\frx4\fry0\frz20.003\pos(732,534)}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:50.86,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnScott\be1\fscy150\fs50\shad0\1c&H2B262E&\bord0\frx0\fry342\frz13.513\pos(880,654)}Ikari Gendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:53.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, read this please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:55.16,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,NERV.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:07:58.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}My father's work.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:08:00.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something I'm needed for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:08.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. He wouldn't send me a letter if he didn't need me for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:11.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I see, you don't get along with your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:14.02,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,---me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:20.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:23.46,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,A real GeoFront!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.14,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:27.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And that is our secret base; NERV Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:32.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's humanity's fortress, the cornerstone to rebuilding our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:39.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see... from the terminal's Western exit,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:41.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Go north to the 3rd gate and take a right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:43.75,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, we need to take Route 8...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:49.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Could they have made this facility any more complicated?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:53.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... this looks like the correct route...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:55.22,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, are we lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.83,0:08:57.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just not used to this place yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.37,0:09:00.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Either way, if we keep heading forward we'll eventually get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:02.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Secondary cooling cycle complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:04.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All personnel, evacuate the tank immediately.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:06.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I want the left arm's conductive plating defrosted and ready to go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:08.78,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,within the next three minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.78,0:09:11.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And don't forget that apoptosis data!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.01,0:09:11.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Roger!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:18.66,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention Professor Akagi: Chief Operations Officer Lt. Colonel Katsuragi, together with one young boy, have arrived at Shaft S36.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.87,0:09:20.10,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:21.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,She's late yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:28.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah... Ritsuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:36.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're 12 minutes past schedule. You were taking so long, I came to greet you personally, Lt. Colonel Katsuragi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:38.47,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We're short on staff and out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:39.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh... Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.38,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:46.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:50.40,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the Chief Engineer and Administrator of NERV's Project E, Akagi Ritsuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:51.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:53.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,M-me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:55.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll leave things here to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.75,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be their first meeting in 3 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:05.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Deputy Commander! The target has begun to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:06.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:08.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,All units, Level One battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:13.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I repeat, all units, Level One battle stations!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:15.51,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ground forces, prepare for combat!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.69,0:10:22.30,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari Shinij-kun, there's something I want to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:32.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The ultimate man-made multipurpose fighting machine. The artificial human, Evangelion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:32.94,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That is Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:36.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Mankind's very last trump card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:38.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This is my father's work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:42.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.22,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.28,0:10:50.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare to sortie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.43,0:10:51.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Sortie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.89,0:10:54.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,But Unit 00 is still frozen, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.70,0:10:57.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless... You intend to use Unit 01?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.31,0:10:59.67,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,There is no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:02.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari Shinji-kun...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:03.30,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:04.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You will pilot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:13.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you call me here, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:15.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,For the same reason you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:19.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm supposed to pilot this and fight that thing I just saw outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:20.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:23.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to! What are you saying all of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:26.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you didn't need me! That's why you left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:29.53,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I need you now, so I called for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.57,0:11:33.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Why... me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:35.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Because no one else can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.75,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:40.38,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen or heard of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:41.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I just can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:43.26,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll explain it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.61,0:11:44.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:48.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:49.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:53.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're going to pilot it, do it now. If not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:54.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:07.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So, we've been found...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:11.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Armored hulls 1 through 8 have been breeched!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:13.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, there isn't much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:17.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Widespread fire alarms in Block D. Closing all fire doors in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:18.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Pilot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.18,0:12:21.51,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:24.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,...sure, I came all this way... but this is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:29.26,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.27,0:12:35.15,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't run away. You have to face your father... and more importantly, yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.39,0:12:40.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I know that! But I just {\i1}can't{\i0\fscx60} {\r} do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.94,0:12:47.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuyutsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:50.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:52.02,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we use her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:55.75,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.45,0:12:58.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:12:59.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:02.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The backup is useless. We need you once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:03.22,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:09.30,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Switch Unit 01's core unit to the L-00 type and reactivate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:13.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Roger. Suspending current tasks. Reactivating.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:14.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Entering reactivation command.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:18.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I knew it. I was never needed...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.35,0:13:21.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Target has broken through the final defense line,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:23.78,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and is proceeding to head right above us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:01.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:22.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I mustn't run away, I mustn't run away, I mustn't run away, I mustn't run away...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:23.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I mustn't run away!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:25.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:27.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pilot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:31.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Third cooling cycle, complete.{\i0} {tlc}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:33.51,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Flywheel rotation shutdown. {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.69,0:14:34.83,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Unlocking the connectors.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.83,0:14:36.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems with the auxiliary power.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.35,0:14:38.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shutdown signal plug extraction complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:41.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Roger, inserting entry plug.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:44.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Unlocking spinal conductive network. Prepare for connection.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.75,0:14:49.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Probe needle insertion complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:52.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Prime sync established. Psychological corruption values within acceptable range.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.74,0:14:55.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Maintaining range between plus-02 and minus-05.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:14:57.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Locking down interior array.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:14:59.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Roger, starting first contact.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.49,0:15:03.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Flooding Entry Plug.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:05.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:09.22,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:13.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Once the LCL fills your lungs, it will provide oxygen directly to your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:15.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Main power source connection complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.76,0:15:19.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Roger.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:21.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Starting second contact.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:22.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Initializing interface.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:27.48,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A-10 nerve connection is normal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:30.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}LCL ionization levels normal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:33.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Set Japanese as the linguistic norm for cognitive interface.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:36.12,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems detected with initial contacts.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:38.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Communication lines open.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:41.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Points on the list up to 1405, all clear.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:44.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Measuring synapse levels. Synchronization rate, 41.3%.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:48.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And he's not even wearing a plug suit! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:52.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Harmonics are in normal levels. Everything's under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:53.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We are ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:55.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare to launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:56.95,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Prepare to launch!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.02,0:15:59.68,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Release primary lock bolts!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.45,0:16:02.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Release confirmed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:04.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Initiating retraction of umbilical bridge.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:08.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Release secondary lock bolts!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:12.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Removing primary restraints.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:15.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Proceeding to remove secondary restraints.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.78,0:16:22.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Disengaging safety systems 01 through 15.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:24.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Disengagement confirmed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:26.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Unit 01 is now free.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.63,0:16:28.47,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Internal power supply, fully charged.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:30.38,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems with the external power socket.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:33.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood. Move Unit 01 to the launch pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.99,0:16:36.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems with the positioning of any of the linear rail tracks.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:39.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Electromagnetic induction system, working normally.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:42.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Unit 01 is now moving to K-52.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.90,0:16:45.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Launch sequence is proceeding normally.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:48.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Eva has arrived at the launch terminal hub.{\i0} {tlc}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:56.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Launch tube clear. All green!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:16:58.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Launch preparations complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.84,0:16:59.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.57,0:17:01.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I have your approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.99,0:17:03.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:06.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Our future depends on defeating the Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:10.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari, you're absolutely sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.67,0:17:12.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,LAUNCH!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:38.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Are you alright, Shinji-kun?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:39.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:41.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Release the final safety lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:45.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Evangelion Unit 01, lift off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:49.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:52.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}for now, just concentrate on walking.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:53.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Walk...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.93,0:18:02.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It walked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:06.98,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:19.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji-kun, stay alert!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.13,0:18:19.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hurry... {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:21.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hurry and get back up!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:34.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji-kun, calm down!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:36.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's not really your arm that's being hurt!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:40.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to Eva's defensive systems?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:42.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Signal inactive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:43.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The field isn't expending.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:44.14,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not working?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.14,0:18:49.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The left arm is damaged!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.97,0:18:49.85,eva alt,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Circuits are going off-line!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:53.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, dodge!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:01.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Frontal cranium is fracturing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:03.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Its armor can't withstand much more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.07,0:19:15.67,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Cranial damage, severity unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.85,0:19:17.38,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Operational integrity compromised!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.60,0:19:18.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the status?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:21.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Synchro graph inverting! Pulse entering reflux!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:22.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut off the circuits! Block the flow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.92,0:19:23.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The signal's being refused, we can't get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:26.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun's status?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No response from the monitoring system. Condition unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:30.48,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 01 has gone silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:31.31,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Misato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:33.59,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.59,0:19:36.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Abort the operation! Pilot rescue has top priority!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:37.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Emergency plug ejection!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:39.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't! It's not responding!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.12,0:19:41.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.86,0:19:50.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Eva has reactivated!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:50.91,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.91,0:19:52.75,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It should be knocked out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:53.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Has it gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:55.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Berserk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:16.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:23.82,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,An AT-Field?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:26.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's pointless. Unless the AT Field is breached...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:28.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,...you can't do anything to an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:36.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Left arm restored!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.57,0:20:37.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:43.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 01 has also raised an AT-Field!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:45.30,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Angel phase space is being neutralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:47.43,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No. It's corroding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:54.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It broke through that AT-Field like it was nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What is Eva's status?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.30,0:22:06.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this Eva's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.00,0:22:08.26,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,True form?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.98,0:22:18.22,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you decided on a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.22,0:22:22.30,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's a boy, Shinji. If it's a girl, then Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:23.98,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.98,0:22:25.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.37,0:22:28.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:32.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji... {\alpha&HFF&}{\t(2200,2201,\alpha&H00&)}Ayanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.29,0:22:34.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.64,0:22:36.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.47,0:22:40.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei... {\alpha&HFF&}{\t(1700,1701,\alpha&H00&)}Ikari...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:42.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.58,0:22:44.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.64,0:22:47.05,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami... {\alpha&HFF&}{\t(1700,1701,\alpha&H00&)}Rei!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.78,0:23:10.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,An unfamiliar ceiling...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:20.67,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The attack of the fourth Angel, and its defeat...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.19,0:23:24.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Then the acquisition of the Third Child...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.01,0:23:25.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And the activation of Eva Unit 01...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:28.38,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Overall the plan is progressing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.59,0:23:32.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, except for the colossal expense necessary to repair Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.79,0:23:35.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Compared to Unit 00 in cryo-suspension,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:36.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,that is hardly a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.27,0:23:40.10,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva Unit 01's recovery operation is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.10,0:23:42.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, it's being locked into Cage 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.74,0:23:45.48,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,A full-systems check will commence at 10:00 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.48,0:23:47.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And the recording from when it went berserk?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.28,0:23:50.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It was blank. Absolutely nothing was recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.65,0:23:53.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And so, we have no idea what the cause was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.42,0:23:57.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Our absolute confidence in its combat performance... may be a bit misplaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.69,0:24:02.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as it can fight the 5th Angel, minor bugs are tolerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.76,0:24:03.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No need for concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.93,0:24:06.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll continue deployment of Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:10.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And Unit 02 and its pilot in Germany are under deployment qualification exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.60,0:24:13.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The construction of Unit 03 is also progressing as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.76,0:24:17.56,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's your responsibility to make proper use of NERV and the Evas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:20.10,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We earnestly hope you will not disappoint us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.10,0:24:24.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Defeating the Angels is but one step in fulfilling our contract with Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.73,0:24:26.69,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnAdobe Garamond Pro Bold\1c&H548586&\3c&H548586&\be1\fscy90\bord0.1\shad0\fs50\pos(655,468)}Human Instrumentality Project
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.73,0:24:26.69,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnAdobe Garamond Pro Bold\1c&H548586&\3c&H548586&\be1\fscy90\bord0.1\shad0\fs50\pos(645,220)}Top Secret
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.73,0:24:26.69,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnAdobe Garamond Pro\1c&H7DB1AB&\3c&H7DB1AB&\be1\fscy90\bord0.1\shad0\fs50\pos(645,608)}27th Interim Report
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.73,0:24:26.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The Human Instrumentality Project...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.90,0:24:30.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Its execution is our ultimate goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.58,0:24:35.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand. Everything will go according to SEELE's scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.55,0:25:04.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,An Angel leaves quite a mark when it's destroyed after it loses its AT Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.16,0:25:07.26,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The blood is like a lake from hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.26,0:25:10.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's got the same nasty feeling as the Second Impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.05,0:25:12.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Our Eva can defeat an Angel...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.87,0:25:16.53,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That alone will give humanity a glimmer of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.73,0:25:19.83,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, looks the pilot of hope just woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.78,0:25:24.31,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,Paging Chief Internist Dr. Ugai. Dr. Ugai.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.31,0:25:28.90,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,Please contact Dr. Azuma in the Emergency Surgical Ward as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.47,0:25:32.98,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,The B Incident Grand Rounds will momentarily begin, according to schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.98,0:25:37.23,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,Would the event directors please make their way to conference room 2? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.66,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&H5C625B&\3c&H5C625B&\be1\bord0.1\frz360.2\pos(420,54)}Tokyo-3 Geo-Front District F
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.66,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&H5C625B&\b0\fscy90\fs30\3c&H5C625B&\be1\bord0.1\frz360.2\pos(307,220)}Ikari, Shinji
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.66,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&H5C625B&\fscy90\b0\fs30\3c&H5C625B&\be1\bord0.1\frz360.2\pos(306,407)}Ikari, Shinji
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.66,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&H929390&\fscy90\b0\fs30\3c&H929390&\be1\bord0.1\frz360.2\pos(1257.358491,402)}Ikari, Shinji
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.66,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&H898A85&\fscy90\b0\fs28\3c&H898A85&\be1\bord0.1\frz360.2\pos(838,215)}Change of address
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.66,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&H7F7F78&\fscy90\b0\fs28\3c&H7F7F78&\be1\bord0.1\frz360.2\pos(784,403)}Male
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.66,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&H7F7F78&\fscy90\b0\fs28\3c&H7F7F78&\be1\bord0.1\frz360.2\pos(985,402)}Head of household
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.66,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&H7F817C&\fscy90\fs40\3c&H7F817C&\be1\bord0.1\frz360.2\pos(980,59)}Resident Registration
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.66,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\1c&H545C50&\fscy90\b0\fs30\3c&H545C50&\be1\bord0.1\frz360.2\pos(258,487)}Former location omitted
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.14,0:25:58.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.66,0:26:03.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, he's been assigned quarters in Block 6. That all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.63,0:26:04.85,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.85,0:26:05.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.00,0:26:07.10,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.11,0:26:09.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. I'm always alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.83,0:26:12.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's always the same wherever I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.33,0:26:13.05,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.27,0:26:18.14,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Like I was saying, I'm taking Shinji back to my place to live with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.14,0:26:19.95,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I have authorization from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.95,0:26:23.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, I wouldn't lay a hand on a little boy like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.53,0:26:27.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course you won't! Honestly, what are you thinking?! Don't even say things like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.24,0:26:29.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,She could never take a joke...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.73,0:26:35.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, we're gonna having a party tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.62,0:26:36.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.82,0:26:40.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,To welcome my new roommate, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.33,0:26:45.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So you've decided to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.11,0:26:50.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I never thought this city would become a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.20,0:26:55.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Indeed! My husband wants me and the children to leave here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.41,0:26:59.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that just today, over 100 people left the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.49,0:27:05.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This may be a fortress city, but those people at NERV seem rather incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:09.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I get chills just thinking about what happened yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.39,0:27:11.02,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.31,0:27:15.48,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.70,0:27:18.38,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,but we're going to take a slight detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.38,0:27:19.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.08,0:27:21.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Someplace special.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.89,0:27:29.16,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This city...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.62,0:27:31.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,...seems so lonely, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.99,0:27:34.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.87,0:28:09.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.73,0:28:12.67,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Buildings are sprouting out of the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.95,0:28:33.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the special fortress-city for intercepting Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.02,0:28:35.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Tokyo-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.67,0:28:37.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This is our city...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:43.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And the city that you protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.13,0:28:53.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like your things have already been delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.54,0:28:57.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,To tell the truth, I've only moved to this city recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.13,0:28:59.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.74,0:29:02.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.52,0:29:03.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.51,0:29:08.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, this is your home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.70,0:29:16.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.24,0:29:18.38,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.76,0:29:22.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.07,0:29:24.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little messy in here, but try to ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.54,0:29:27.31,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.21,0:29:29.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,...a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.27,0:29:32.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh sorry, could you put the food in the fridge please?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.58,0:29:34.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.21,0:29:35.83,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ice...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.83,0:29:37.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Snacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.74,0:29:40.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And nothing but beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.98,0:29:43.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of life does she lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.47,0:29:46.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.17,0:29:47.22,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.05,0:30:00.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I love it! This is what makes life worth living!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.88,0:30:05.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Not hungry? For instant food, it's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.38,0:30:10.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... I'm just not used to this sort of meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.24,0:30:12.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No! You just can't be so picky!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.61,0:30:17.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.08,0:30:19.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't this fun...?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.53,0:30:22.46,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Having a meal with another person?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.34,0:30:24.91,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh... yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.62,0:30:26.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.55,0:30:31.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Since this is your home now, feel free to just let loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.94,0:30:33.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.35,0:30:36.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on... This "Yes, yes, yes, yes." is getting on my nerves...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.17,0:30:40.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a boy aren't you?! Show some backbone, will you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.40,0:30:42.51,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.09,0:30:44.15,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.46,0:30:49.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Once you'll get in the bath, all those bad feelings will just wash away in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.40,0:30:51.16,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Bathing lets you wash your life anew.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.29,0:31:02.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,M-M-Misato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.87,0:31:03.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.56,0:31:12.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, him? He's my pet bird. They call them hot spring penguins.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.10,0:31:22.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Birds like that actually exist?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.02,0:31:27.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,They used to be a lot more common 15 years ago.\NHis name is Pen-pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.38,0:31:30.68,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be your other roommate in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.70,0:31:33.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway... shouldn't you be covering that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.01,0:31:45.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Maybe I'm being overly flamboyant... he might be able to see right through me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.30,0:31:48.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Katsuragi Misato-san...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.65,0:31:52.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She's not a bad person.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.64,0:31:54.43,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Bathing lets you wash your life anew!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.48,0:31:59.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I tend to remember bad things when I'm in a bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.02,0:32:02.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,How was Rei doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.81,0:32:07.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You went to her hospital this afternoon, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.69,0:32:13.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,There are no problems. Preparing to restart the frozen Unit 00 is more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.41,0:32:17.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure about using your son? His mental state seems to be very unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.21,0:32:23.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about him. His condition will give us the perfect pretext to reinstate Unit 00.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.50,0:32:26.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll proceed according to Lt. Colonel Katsuragi's suggestion, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.42,0:32:28.38,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnKims Hand\b0\fs46\frx22\fry38\1c&H171611&\pos(740,195)\frz330.264}Shinji's
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.42,0:32:28.38,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnKims Hand\fs46\b0\frx16\fry34\frz337.115\1c&H171611&\pos(704,381)}Room
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.26,0:32:35.22,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs80\frz332.5\bord0.1\be1\1c&H3C261E&\3c&H3C261E&\pos(748,193)\clip(m 620 146 l 961 313 1022 236 730 78)}Change of Address
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.26,0:32:35.22,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs80\frz332.5\bord0.1\be1\1c&H120C08&\3c&H120C08&\pos(748,193)\clip(m 481 70 l 626 144 719 84 593 6)}Change of Address
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.26,0:32:35.22,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs60\frz332.5\bord0.1\be1\1c&H4E3428&\3c&H4E3428&\pos(514,512)}Ikari,  Shinji
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.95,0:32:45.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even without a preliminary report, they suddenly selected him as the Third Child.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.65,0:32:48.98,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And as if in response, the Fourth Angel attacks.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.20,0:32:53.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}In addition, Commander Ikari forces his son to pilot.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.58,0:32:56.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I certainly feel very uneasy about that fact...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.37,0:33:01.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But still, even after successfully defeating that Angel, I feel surprisingly...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.32,0:33:03.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.93,0:33:08.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Another unfamiliar ceiling...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.90,0:33:11.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No surprise...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.65,0:33:14.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Nothing about this city is familiar.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.16,0:33:17.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This is your home now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.65,0:33:20.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why am I even here?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.07,0:33:37.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun? I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.91,0:33:43.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.52,0:33:46.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You've done a wonderful thing worth praising today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.16,0:33:48.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You should be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.83,0:33:50.59,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodnight, Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.59,0:33:52.67,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.97,0:34:04.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, transfer kid. I had to hit ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.09,0:34:05.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,To settle the score with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.20,0:34:12.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Real sorry. That guy's little sister was injured in that big incident the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.34,0:34:14.38,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's just how it is with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.96,0:34:18.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like I piloted it because I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.63,0:34:42.02,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}How is this something people would praise me for?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.02,0:34:45.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why do I have to get hit just because I piloted the Eva?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.98,0:34:52.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Is everything alright, Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.24,0:34:52.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.13,0:34:56.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Within each Angel there is a central core.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.57,0:35:02.16,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The only way to defeat an Angel directly is to destroy that core.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.62,0:35:07.12,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Therefore, center on target, then pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.75,0:35:13.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This way, you can dispose of them accurately if you master the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.86,0:35:14.38,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.33,0:35:24.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Good. Continue practicing like this in induction mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.03,0:35:24.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.25,0:35:34.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Still, I'm quite surprised Shinji-kun suddenly changed his mind about piloting...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.97,0:35:39.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That boy only gets through life by silently obeying whatever people tell him, doesn't he? {tlc}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.74,0:35:44.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Center on target, then pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.31,0:35:48.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Center on target, then pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.63,0:35:51.47,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Center on target, then pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.02,0:35:54.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Center on target, then pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.88,0:35:58.43,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Which reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.43,0:36:01.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't Shinji-kun hit by one of his classmates at his new school?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.58,0:36:04.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Is our pilot security sufficient?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.06,0:36:07.05,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no problem with our intelligence department's surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.05,0:36:08.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, it wasn't very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.96,0:36:12.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It would better if we stayed out of his private life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.96,0:36:14.83,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't he live with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.83,0:36:17.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,His maintenance is your responsibility too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.49,0:36:18.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's just it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.22,0:36:22.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's difficult... He's far more naïve than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.31,0:36:23.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Hah, complaining already?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.97,0:36:26.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You were the one who was so adamant about taking him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.62,0:36:28.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Quiet, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.81,0:36:39.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right, he doesn't have much of a personality for making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.76,0:36:43.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you heard of the "Hedgehog's dilemma"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.07,0:36:46.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Hedgehog? The little spiky things?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.27,0:36:50.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Hedgehogs have a hard time sharing warmth with other hedgehogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.77,0:36:55.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The closer they become, the more they hurt each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.65,0:36:57.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,People are like that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.48,0:37:00.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Like with Shinji-kun right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.07,0:37:04.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The more pain his heart endures, the more afraid he becomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.41,0:37:11.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, eventually he'll realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.67,0:37:17.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Becoming an adult means drawing close and growing apart over and over...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.07,0:37:22.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,...and discovering the way to avoid wounding one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.20,0:37:24.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I certainly hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.17,0:37:31.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, when are we gonna get budget approval to upgrade Block B here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.04,0:37:34.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva's maintenance and armaments are the top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.32,0:37:35.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe there's no money left?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.64,0:37:38.40,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,My ass is freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.46,0:37:49.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,An emergency call...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.78,0:37:51.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.76,0:38:07.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}We have direct visual of inbound object.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.66,0:38:09.68,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}E747 has also confirmed the object.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.68,0:38:13.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Analysis indicates Pattern Blue. There's no doubt. It's the fifth Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.54,0:38:15.56,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,All hands, level one battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.56,0:38:18.43,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Roger, ground-to-air missiles ready!{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.43,0:38:21.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Tokyo-3 entering combat configuration.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.67,0:38:25.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Retracting central block.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.42,0:39:22.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Center block and Districts One through Seven's retraction is complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.85,0:39:25.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All governmental departments have been notified.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.29,0:39:27.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Target continuing inbound movement.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.07,0:39:30.22,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The anti-air interception system is 48% activated.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.48,0:39:32.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Status of noncombatants and civilians?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.96,0:39:35.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We've already received a complete evacuation report.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.37,0:39:41.96,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All Elementary and Middle School student classes, please gather in your designated blocks.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.96,0:39:47.06,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,There is a lost child at shelter number 323 in Sector Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.27,0:39:45.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.06,0:39:46.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Just text again?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.65,0:39:49.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,They're controlling the broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.76,0:39:52.12,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,They won't show us regular citizens anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.31,0:39:54.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Not even a big event like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.01,0:40:04.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a waste of tax money.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.39,0:40:08.05,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Some people just aren't happy unless they burn through some ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.91,0:40:11.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The Japanese government is demanding we send out the Evangelion.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.88,0:40:15.26,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,How annoying. It's not like we weren't going to do that without their orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.87,0:40:20.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}We've started the entry. Ionizing LCL.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.73,0:40:23.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Father's not even watching me... Why am I piloting this again?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.18,0:40:26.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}People hate me for this...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.28,0:40:33.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I wanna talk to you about something, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.63,0:40:34.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.72,0:40:36.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Just for a minute, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.71,0:40:37.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.91,0:40:39.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right, and then-
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.24,0:40:40.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Class Rep!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.52,0:40:41.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.08,0:40:43.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We, uh, both need to take a leak!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.33,0:40:46.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, make it quick!!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.82,0:40:48.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So, what's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.28,0:40:51.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see it at least once before I die!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.20,0:40:52.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That battle up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.32,0:40:57.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the real deal! If I don't go now, who knows when I'll get another chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.28,0:40:59.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, Kensuke, what is it with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.76,0:41:02.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,"If you waste this moment, you may waste everything."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.11,0:41:06.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on... Just help me get past the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.06,0:41:10.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess I've got no choice. You're a real slave to your passions, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.66,0:41:15.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji-kun, are you ready for launch?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.63,0:41:16.68,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.68,0:41:21.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Remember. Continuous Gatling gun fire as you neutralize its AT Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.66,0:41:23.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Just like in practice. You'll be fine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.15,0:41:24.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.89,0:41:25.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.45,0:41:43.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Incredible! This was worth the trouble! {tlc}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.92,0:41:45.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! This is what I've been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.90,0:41:52.82,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.36,0:41:57.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Center on target, then pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.36,0:41:57.31,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Expanding A.T. Field.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.18,0:41:59.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Center on target, then pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.31,0:41:59.55,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Proceed according to the plans, okay, Shinji-kun?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.55,0:42:00.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.38,0:42:10.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot! All that smoke is obscuring the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.29,0:42:27.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The heck? He's gettin' his ass kicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.32,0:42:28.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,He's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.27,0:42:29.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We're sending up a spare rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.11,0:42:31.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Grab it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.28,0:42:35.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji-kun...? Shinji-kun?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.19,0:42:40.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man... Your beating must have shaken him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.25,0:42:41.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.35,0:43:02.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Umbillical Cable has been severed!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.81,0:43:04.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva switching to internal power supply!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.76,0:43:07.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Operational time remaining is 4 minutes 53 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.63,0:43:13.78,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.73,0:43:21.30,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji-kun, are you all right?! Shinji-kun!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.30,0:43:22.30,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Damage report?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.30,0:43:24.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems. He's good to go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.50,0:43:35.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun's classmates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.37,0:43:36.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What are they doing there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.08,0:43:47.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Why isn't he fighting back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.19,0:43:50.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he can't move freely... because we're here!?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.67,0:43:54.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Unit 01 will reach operational time limit in 3 minutes 28 seconds!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.19,0:43:56.94,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Palm armor overheating. Damage, 58%.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.97,0:44:04.16,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji-kun, let those two into the cockpit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.58,0:44:07.75,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Once they're in, get out of there! We'll start over afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.09,0:44:12.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You two, get in, quickly!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.05,0:44:16.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What the-- Is this water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.69,0:44:18.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,My camera! My camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.58,0:44:18.98,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}System restarting.{\i0}{tlc}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.53,0:44:25.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Palm surface meltdown has reached the 3rd protective layer!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.94,0:44:35.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Now's your chance! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.12,0:44:43.54,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Use escape route 34. Retreat on the eastern side of the mountain.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.31,0:44:44.53,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, transfer kid, she said "retreat!"
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.64,0:44:48.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I mustn't run away... I mustn't run away... I mustn't run away...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.20,0:44:46.16,eva alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Transfer kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.12,0:44:53.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Progressive Knife equipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.59,0:44:58.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji-kun, listen to my order! Fall back now!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.70,0:44:59.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji-kun!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.90,0:45:05.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.17,0:45:28.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 01 will reach operational time limit in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.52,0:45:31.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,28, 27, 26...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.55,0:45:35.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,25, 24, 23, 22...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.97,0:45:42.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,13, 12, 11, 10...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.92,0:45:47.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,9, 8, 7, 6, 5...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.80,0:45:51.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,4, 3, 2, 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.48,0:46:02.67,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva Unit 01 has ceased operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.67,0:46:05.53,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Target has completely disintegrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.84,0:46:46.82,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you ignore my orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.69,0:46:48.82,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.27,0:46:51.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I am your operational supervisor, am I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.26,0:46:52.95,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.29,0:46:56.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's your duty to follow the orders I give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.40,0:46:57.47,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.07,0:46:58.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.20,0:47:01.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure this doesn't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.01,0:47:02.59,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.67,0:47:05.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really understand what I'm telling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.05,0:47:08.91,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I understand, Misato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.10,0:47:12.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, we won, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.31,0:47:16.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pilot it if you tell me to. Isn't that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.38,0:47:32.78,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough. Go back and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.41,0:47:59.49,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,Next stop is Nagao Pass. Nagao Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.80,0:48:01.73,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,Please exit to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.28,0:48:48.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't plan on coming home...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.34,0:48:49.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.02,0:49:41.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari, Ikari Shinji.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.74,0:49:45.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this? He just got here, and he's already absent?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.17,0:49:49.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well. Now then, I'll hand back the tests from the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.49,0:50:30.91,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I've had enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.33,0:50:35.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Please take me back to Misato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.74,0:50:59.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Did your little stroll clear things up for you, Ikari Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.87,0:51:07.95,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Not really. It didn't really matter. Nothing does.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.70,0:51:10.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have any freedom anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.74,0:51:16.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I have no choice but to pilot Eva, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.09,0:51:18.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the only reason my father called for me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.67,0:51:22.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. I'll pilot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.07,0:51:25.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If that's what everyone wants, that's what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.51,0:51:28.43,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You talk about everyone else, but what about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.43,0:51:33.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I know I can't do this. I bet everybody else does, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.90,0:51:36.98,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,But Ayanami is hurt, and you and father want...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.98,0:51:38.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.27,0:51:40.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This has nothing to do with anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.60,0:51:44.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to decide if you want to be the pilot for the Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.93,0:51:46.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're free to go if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.90,0:51:50.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You have all the freedom you want. Do as you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.30,0:51:59.59,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, your son's actions followed the plan to the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.02,0:52:03.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Next we must make him and Rei get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.19,0:52:06.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,All is according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.98,0:52:09.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,A scenario written out 14 years ago. {The scenario written out 14 years ago?}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.24,0:52:12.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,These poor children's fates have already been determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.45,0:52:14.94,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you find that a bit harsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.59,0:52:24.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, hurry it up! And don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.89,0:52:27.53,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't do this, I won't feel like it's settled!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.53,0:52:31.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's just the kind of straightforward guy he is. I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.08,0:52:41.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Now we're even. I'm sorry for hitting you, Ikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.44,0:52:56.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Go, go, Kayoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.39,0:52:59.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If you lose, you're buying us a pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.11,0:53:00.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.27,0:53:01.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,In your dreams!!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.07,0:53:03.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Please! Give me one more chance!!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.80,0:53:05.10,eva alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Ew, the boys are peeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.10,0:53:05.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Pervs!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.77,0:53:06.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.87,0:53:08.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Suzuhara's gaze is so lewd!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.85,0:53:10.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari-kun~!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.41,0:53:14.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami Rei, age 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.82,0:53:20.12,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,She was the first candidate chosen by the Marduk Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.12,0:53:21.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The First Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.64,0:53:26.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Specifically, she is the exclusive operator of the prototype Evangelion, Unit 00.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.27,0:53:30.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Her personal history is blank. Completely erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.18,0:53:33.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So, to save her, my father...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.07,0:53:36.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Critical error in startup system!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.01,0:53:37.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Failures in Stage 3 routines!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.71,0:53:40.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Nervous system elements rejected.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.08,0:53:41.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The main transmission system is scrambled! It's overflowing!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.08,0:53:44.53,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Neural pulse flow reversing! I'm unable to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.64,0:53:46.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Direct camera feed, down!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.79,0:53:49.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Entry plug unstable. Eva is refusing to release it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.75,0:53:52.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Abort contacts. Close off all circuits up to number six.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.20,0:53:55.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't! The signal won't go through!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.95,0:53:58.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 00 is out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.73,0:54:00.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Abort the test. Cut all power.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.88,0:54:01.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.83,0:54:09.98,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 00 has switched to auxiliary power.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.98,0:54:12.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,35 seconds to total system shutdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.35,0:54:14.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Failsafe system has yet to activate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.86,0:54:22.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous! Please step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.46,0:54:26.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The auto-eject has activated!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.35,0:54:26.78,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.33,0:54:33.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}We still cannot control Unit 00!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.74,0:54:35.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Quickly, release specialized Bakelite!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.80,0:54:37.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.02,0:54:43.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ten seconds to complete shutdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.88,0:54:47.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,8, 7, 6, 5...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.87,0:54:51.46,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.03,0:54:55.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 00 has ceased all activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.72,0:55:11.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.50,0:55:13.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.21,0:55:19.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.85,0:55:27.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It was so sudden. I couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.06,0:55:31.05,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It was deleted from the official report, but it's an undisputed fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.45,0:55:35.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 00 just went berserk, and is still being unfrozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.06,0:55:36.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that a bit hasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.57,0:55:41.00,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The Angels have reappeared. It's our top priority to reinforce our military strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.42,0:55:43.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.72,0:55:46.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We've already run reactivation tests with Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.70,0:55:48.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 00 itself is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.99,0:55:52.59,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Once the adjustments to the nerve connections are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.65,0:55:55.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so we can re-deploy it soon, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.31,0:56:01.75,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.75,0:56:04.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is she always alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.29,0:56:06.85,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Eva Unit 01 is beginning third coolant phase.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.18,0:56:10.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Please set all systems in Cage 6 to phase three.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.35,0:56:16.78,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Copying the all-range data of the entry plug to Melchior. Data sent.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.57,0:56:20.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Begin third cooling phase.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.52,0:56:22.94,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Copying situation data from Casper to Melchior.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.94,0:56:27.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Currently, Unit 01's plug depth is at 0,8. It's within acceptable measurement range.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.86,0:56:32.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}T-minus 150 minutes to Unit 00's conductive systems restart and testing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.83,0:56:37.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Roger. Routine synchronization test, Program 508 is now complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.28,0:56:38.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Good work, Shinji-kun.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.20,0:56:43.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So, what's it like living with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.64,0:56:45.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's alright. I'm getting used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.43,0:56:47.00,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Still a little nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.17,0:56:50.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your first time living with a man, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.45,0:56:53.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't like 8 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.73,0:56:55.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This time, it's not an intimate relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.72,0:56:56.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.45,0:57:00.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun is still here because of you, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.64,0:57:02.14,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're wrong there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.77,0:57:04.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably because his father's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.85,0:57:10.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,He wants his father to acknowledge him.\NTo pat him on the shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.49,0:57:13.10,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,To praise him, even if it's just one word.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.68,0:57:16.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I think he wants a love that will wipe away his loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.27,0:57:21.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,He's conflicted over his father, just like you are, Misato.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.94,0:57:28.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why Commander Ikari acts so distant with his own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.49,0:57:30.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And it looks like he talks to Rei a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.50,0:57:31.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a terrible balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.99,0:57:35.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Lately, it seems like men have no interest in anything other than themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.27,0:57:38.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a tough time to be a woman, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.67,0:57:41.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.23,0:57:45.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's about time. I have to head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.69,0:57:48.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a worker bee, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.50,0:57:53.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Take these if you're going home, Misato. It's Shinji-kun's official security card,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.25,0:57:55.15,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,...and Ayanami Rei's renewed card.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.15,0:57:57.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot about these.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.32,0:57:59.12,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you ask Shinji to give this to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.62,0:58:02.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.70,0:58:06.75,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami Rei...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.31,0:58:14.46,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Why was father smiling with her...?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.03,0:58:17.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Why won't he smile for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.82,0:58:50.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.34,0:58:55.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, it's Ikari!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.80,0:58:59.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami, I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.66,0:59:36.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Could these be Ayanami's?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.11,0:59:52.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no... Um... I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.65,0:59:56.91,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.12,1:00:30.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you move?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.71,1:00:36.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,U-um...!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.21,1:00:55.00,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.30,1:00:58.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I was... Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.09,1:01:00.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.30,1:01:07.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I... I was asked to... I mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.80,1:01:10.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The uhhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.13,1:01:14.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The card! The c-card was renewed and... and I c-came to deliver it...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.22,1:01:21.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So... So... It's not like I was trying to...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.75,1:01:32.05,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ritsuko-san said she forgot to give it to you. Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.05,1:01:36.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I rang the doorbell, but no one answered... and the door was unlocked, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.99,1:01:51.71,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,Offices in the Central Dogma are currently accessible.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.00,1:01:55.28,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,Group 3 visitors are requested to please use Direct Gate 4.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.21,1:02:03.22,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's your new card, Ayanami. Ritsuko-san left it with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.11,1:02:13.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about before.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.11,1:02:14.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.67,1:02:21.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Ayanami... Aren't you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.02,1:02:24.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,About piloting that Evangelion again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.63,1:02:26.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Why should I be?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.87,1:02:31.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you got hurt in that test...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.28,1:02:34.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So... Are you really okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.31,1:02:38.51,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.92,1:02:43.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,But... aren't you afraid it will go berserk again?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.45,1:02:47.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Or we could lose to an Angel and die!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.71,1:02:50.95,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're Commander Ikari's son, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.83,1:02:55.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have faith in your father's work?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.24,1:02:58.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not! Not from a father like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.58,1:03:03.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.37,1:03:28.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Monitored object is proceeding past the Odawara defense Line.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.18,1:03:30.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Object analysis complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.34,1:03:32.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Pattern blue. Angel confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.68,1:03:34.91,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,As we thought. The 6th Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.30,1:03:36.40,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.98,1:03:38.83,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare Unit 01 for sortie.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.40,1:03:41.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Prepare to launch Unit 01!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.10,1:03:43.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Anti-air interception weapons armed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.48,1:03:48.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The target is passing above Lake Ashinoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.80,1:03:50.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Evangelion Unit 01 is ready to launch!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.82,1:03:51.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.84,1:04:02.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,High energy reaction detected inside the target!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.90,1:04:03.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.62,1:04:04.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me...!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.40,1:04:08.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.79,1:04:29.46,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Lower synchronization rate to minimum!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.46,1:04:30.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Deploy blast shield!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.01,1:04:55.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Abort intercept! Begin emergency recovery of Unit 01!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.70,1:04:58.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't! The catapult has melted. It's unusable!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.39,1:04:59.47,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the AT-Field?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.47,1:05:02.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Fully raised. Structural integrity is holding, but barely!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.40,1:05:10.46,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No! No more of this!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.46,1:05:13.47,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Let me out! Get me out of here, father!!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.58,1:05:14.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Abort the operation!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.72,1:05:17.78,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Place top priority on the pilot's safety! Force eject the plug!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.78,1:05:18.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That won't do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.28,1:05:24.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If the pilot is taken out, Eva's AT-Field will completely disappear!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.36,1:05:27.40,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Things will go from bad to worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.37,1:05:29.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.20,1:05:37.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no other choice...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.81,1:05:41.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Emergency recovery! Blow the explosive bolts!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.71,1:06:05.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The target has ceased fire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.50,1:06:07.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Unit 01 retrieved. Sending to Cage 99!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.76,1:06:08.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Rescue team, stand by!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.92,1:06:11.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,First priority is cooling the LCL in the plug!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.33,1:06:13.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Pilot confirmed! His heart rate is weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.21,1:06:16.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Boost plug suit life support to max! Begin cardiac massage!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.36,1:06:16.82,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.78,1:06:21.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Pulse confirmed!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.24,1:06:22.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Forcefully eject the plug!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.12,1:06:26.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Stabilizing possible rupture point in the interior.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.44,1:06:28.00,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Begin emergency LCL draining!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.00,1:06:28.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,At once!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.33,1:06:30.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Draining LCL.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.98,1:06:32.05,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry emergency treatment!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.00,1:07:13.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The target is currently invading from above.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.89,1:07:15.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's in the midst of drilling through to the Geo-Front.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.92,1:07:19.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Its objective is a direct attack on our NERV HQ, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.38,1:07:23.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, let's hear the results of each department's analysis.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.92,1:07:25.48,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Judging from the previous battle...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.48,1:07:29.94,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,...the target automatically engages any enemy within a certain range.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.04,1:07:33.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Meaning it's impossible for Eva to engage it in close combat, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.17,1:07:34.48,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,How's its AT Field?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.80,1:07:36.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Still operational. And to make matters worse...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.74,1:07:40.26,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,with its phase pattern constantly shifting, the field's surface is unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.26,1:07:42.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Neutralizing it will be very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.79,1:07:44.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,According to Magi's calculations...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.47,1:07:53.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,...to pierce the enemy's AT Field, we'd need to drop so many aerial N2 Mines that it would destroy NERV HQ as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.54,1:07:56.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The Magi 2 at Matsushiro reached the same conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.09,1:08:02.94,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, the Japanese government and U.N. Forces are petitioning NERV HQ to do just that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.94,1:08:05.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,An easy suggestion to make when they're not the ones in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.02,1:08:08.43,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If this place falls, then all is lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.43,1:08:12.94,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,However, the drill has already breached the second layer of armor plating.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.14,1:08:15.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's already begun penetrating the third.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.64,1:08:19.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The estimated time from today until it has passed through all 22 layers,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.88,1:08:25.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,reaching the area above HQ, is 12:06:54 AM tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.39,1:08:27.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We have ten hours and fourteen minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.69,1:08:30.91,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,To make matters worse, Unit 00 needs to be calibrated before it's operational.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.91,1:08:34.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 01 is also currently unmovable due to its previous injury.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.03,1:08:38.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The situation sure isn't favorable.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.65,1:08:41.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We're certainly backed into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.13,1:08:43.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Should we wave the white flag?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.75,1:08:48.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe... but before we do, I have a little something I'd like to try.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.36,1:08:52.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The intelligence division should be aware of the JSSDF's secret weapon, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.89,1:09:13.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Still, though, it's reckless to use this in an operation, Operations Chief Katsuragi.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.78,1:09:15.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,"Reckless" is a bit rude.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.71,1:09:19.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,In can be done within the remaining nine hours, and it's the best shot we've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.06,1:09:21.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Operation Yashima...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.96,1:09:26.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,As the name suggests, we'll be taking electrical power from all over Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.09,1:09:32.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And then direct it toward JSSDF's secret prototype weapon, a high power positron cannon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.62,1:09:40.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Since it's unfinished, and can't be used on its own, it's been modified for Eva to control it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.52,1:09:47.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Convincing the U.N. Forces is one thing, but the Ministry of Home Affairs and JSSDF, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.97,1:09:51.02,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's just say they owe me a few favors.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.22,1:09:56.15,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You sure are good at what you do. {t/n - this is an expression. "a serpent on a snake's path", a professional knows their field the best. many potientail renderings from this...}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.74,1:10:03.63,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,From midnight tonight to before dawn tomorrow, the entire country will experience a large-scale blackout.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.76,1:10:07.92,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,We ask for everyone's cooperation. I repeat...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.12,1:10:14.32,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,From midnight tonight to before dawn tomorrow, the entire country will experience a large-scale blackout.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.32,1:10:17.27,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,We ask for everyone's cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.65,1:10:16.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Alright. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.76,1:10:17.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.27,1:10:24.28,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,From midnight tonight to before dawn tomorrow, the entire country will experience a large-scale blackout.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.28,1:10:27.24,eva up,,0000,0000,0000,,We ask for everyone's cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.08,1:10:51.30,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Angel has penetrated through the 7th armored plate!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.41,1:10:53.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the status of our energy system?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.12,1:10:58.12,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Power will be fed directly from the Shingotenba substation and two backup generators!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.12,1:11:02.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Superconductor power lines now being laid towards lower Futagoyama.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.86,1:11:08.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The transformer relay system is scheduled to be up and running at 10:50 PM Japan time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.56,1:11:10.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,How's progress on the sniping system?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.63,1:11:14.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems in assembly. We'll have no trouble making it by the operation start time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.63,1:11:16.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What is Unit 01's status?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.45,1:11:19.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's currently being outfitted with G-type sniping equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.91,1:11:21.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It will be ready to deploy in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.91,1:11:24.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger that! All that's left now is the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.85,1:11:28.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,But I wonder... Will he be willing to pilot it again?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.32,1:11:34.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you plan to do about Unit 01's pilot?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.83,1:11:37.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too soon to test the dummy plug system.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.36,1:11:42.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We have no other practical means other than letting the current pilot handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.39,1:11:44.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,In the worst case, do we brainwash him?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.65,1:11:47.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If things don't work out, there's always Rei.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.75,1:11:52.01,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei in Unit 01? Isn't that a bit too risky?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.76,1:11:58.16,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We must use whatever means are available to us. \NWe still have eight Angels we must defeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.72,1:12:01.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And then, we realize our goal...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.87,1:12:13.26,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I hate it... piloting the Eva.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.95,1:12:18.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I do it well, no one praises me for doing it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.70,1:12:22.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I fail, everyone will hate me. Or, even worse, I could just die.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.35,1:12:24.98,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why am I even here?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.34,1:12:32.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I thought things would change here.\NThat maybe good things would happen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.36,1:12:34.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I didn't come here to be put through hell.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.61,1:12:38.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}So you plan to spend the rest of your life running away from everything unpleasant?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.31,1:12:41.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Live?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.19,1:12:43.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why am I alive, anyway?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.86,1:12:47.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I used to think I didn't have a choice in the matter.{\i0} {}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.07,1:12:52.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Whether it's my father or Misato-san, no one really needs me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.88,1:12:55.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I couldn't pilot Eva, there would be no need for me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.58,1:12:58.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That's why I have no choice but to pilot Eva.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.11,1:13:02.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That's why I'm able to stay here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.02,1:13:05.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But when I pilot my Eva, I...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.06,1:13:11.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This ceiling again...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.76,1:13:16.02,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this all I get for piloting that thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.23,1:13:21.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami...?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.38,1:13:24.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You were here the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.75,1:13:32.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here to tell you about the schedule for Operation Yashima, which will commence at midnight tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.25,1:13:38.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Pilots Ikari and Ayanami are to report at Terminal 2 at 19:30.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.39,1:13:43.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,At 20:00, Unit 01, accompanied by Unit 00, will be transferred.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.44,1:13:45.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Launch is scheduled at 20:05.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.73,1:13:48.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,By 20:30, they will arrive at the 2nd Futagoyama fortress.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.23,1:13:52.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,After that, they will await further orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.04,1:13:55.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,When the clock strikes midnight, the operation will begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.36,1:13:58.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Your food.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.27,1:14:02.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't feel like eating anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.53,1:14:04.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We leave in 90 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.08,1:14:07.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're saying I'll be piloting that thing again?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.80,1:14:08.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.58,1:14:13.12,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to. I don't want to feel that scared anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.12,1:14:17.51,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's terrifying...! But l can't even run away...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.51,1:14:19.22,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're afraid of Eva?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.13,1:14:21.77,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Then stay and rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.30,1:14:24.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rest?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.76,1:14:26.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I will pilot Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.56,1:14:30.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.43,1:14:32.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.94,1:14:51.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Angel is penetrating through the 17th armored plate!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.34,1:14:54.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Target will reach NERV Headquarters in 4 minutes 55 seconds.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.21,1:14:58.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The new western Hakone line and the southern Tounosawa overhead line have been electrified.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.72,1:15:03.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Currently, the number 16 substation is continuing to establish its transformer equipment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.24,1:15:08.48,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}500,000 volts are flowing through the transformers as planned. No changes to the time sheet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.98,1:15:12.29,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The 28th transformer group will arrive after a five minute delay.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.29,1:15:15.40,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All related persons, please hurry to your respective lines.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.70,1:15:20.78,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Begin proceeding to Stage Four of the simulation. Now re-checking recovery and support systems.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.22,1:15:27.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All SMES have been set up. Sequential startup from the first bundle confirmed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.47,1:15:32.59,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All mega-high voltage superconductor transformers' opening and closing checks complete. No problems.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.52,1:15:43.85,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So this is the giant positron cannon?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.25,1:15:47.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The assembly was rushed, but theoretically it should work.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.97,1:15:52.14,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We're zeroing the alignment on our end and getting it ready to link with the G-type equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.14,1:15:54.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And, well, the rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.74,1:15:57.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean up to the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.88,1:16:00.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Misato, I sure hope this works.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.09,1:16:08.83,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, you were supposed to report long ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.63,1:16:15.00,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You chose to stay here, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.64,1:16:18.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Then do your job properly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.81,1:16:22.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm afraid of piloting the Eva...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.71,1:16:25.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You and the others have nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.37,1:16:30.07,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're always just giving orders from your base underground.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.07,1:16:32.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the only one experiencing these terrifying things.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.06,1:16:34.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You all are hypocrites.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.01,1:16:44.43,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Come with me for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.24,1:16:53.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Fifteen years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.23,1:16:57.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,half of humanity died in the Second Impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.64,1:17:01.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If the Angels cause a Third Impact now,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.55,1:17:04.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,humanity will die out. No one will survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.65,1:17:07.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard this story countless times already.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.92,1:17:16.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If an Angel ever reaches Level EEE of NERV Headquarters...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.08,1:17:20.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,an automatic self-destruct would commence.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.45,1:17:27.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We will sacrifice ourselves to prevent the Third Impact from happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.57,1:17:31.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone who works here understands and accepts that risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.05,1:17:50.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.46,1:17:55.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be... An Eva...!?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.34,1:18:02.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Not quite. The bringer of life to this planet, and the agent of its extinction...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.33,1:18:05.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The Second Angel, Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.63,1:18:06.80,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Lilith...?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.03,1:18:10.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Some believe it will act as the trigger for the Third Impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.80,1:18:15.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We fight with the Evas to protect Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.54,1:18:17.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That is something that only you can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.29,1:18:22.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We're entrusting the future of humanity to you and the Eva.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.58,1:18:27.05,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And why give me that painful responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.55,1:18:31.83,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No reason. Fate chose you, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.65,1:18:37.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,But you're not the only one putting your life on the line here, Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.28,1:18:39.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We all are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.44,1:18:47.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pilot it... one more time...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.91,1:19:05.68,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I will now inform you of your roles in this operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.68,1:19:06.68,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.68,1:19:07.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.45,1:19:09.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You will act as gunner in Unit 01.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.62,1:19:10.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.62,1:19:12.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei, you and Unit 00 will be on defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.48,1:19:14.27,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.75,1:19:18.10,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The operation this time calls for utmost precision.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.58,1:19:24.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why, instead of the uncalibrated Unit 00, we chose to use Unit 01, even though it's still undergoing repairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.19,1:19:26.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.65,1:19:32.68,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Because of the Earth's rotation, magnetic field, and gravity, the positron cannon won't fire straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.68,1:19:35.12,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget to take those factors into account.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.65,1:19:38.46,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You must strike the core in a single shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.84,1:19:41.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't know where this one's core is.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.54,1:19:46.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. There's a portion that materializes during its attack phase.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.24,1:19:49.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We believe that's where its core is located.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.79,1:19:55.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Your sniping position, as well as various factors that affect your trajectory, will all be inputted by us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.24,1:20:01.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Thus, all you have to do is to follow the on-screen prompts, and fire when the center indicators meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.56,1:20:03.36,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The machine will handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.46,1:20:10.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,However only one spot has been set up to supply all of this power.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.58,1:20:14.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,For that reason, Unit 01 cannot change its firing position.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.39,1:20:17.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Retreating isn't an option, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.41,1:20:18.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.47,1:20:21.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,So what if I miss, and the Angel shoots back?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.61,1:20:26.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't concern yourself with unnecessary thoughts now. Focus on destroying the target in one shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.36,1:20:29.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't, we'll be in a big pinch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.36,1:20:34.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I... I am supposed to protect Unit 01?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.21,1:20:34.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.30,1:20:36.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.92,1:20:39.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time. Both of you, get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.64,1:20:40.14,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.00,1:20:50.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.72,1:20:55.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,we might die this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.80,1:20:58.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.08,1:21:01.91,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You won't die.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.67,1:21:04.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.28,1:21:12.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not worth protecting...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.07,1:21:16.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,This message was left at NERV Public Affairs Dept.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.71,1:21:26.88,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Um... This is Suzuhara.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.66,1:21:31.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ikari... No, let me call you Shinji.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.62,1:21:33.40,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji, we're counting on you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.39,1:21:37.43,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey, this is Aida.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.43,1:21:39.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ikari, do your best!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.47,1:22:27.26,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami, why do you pilot your Eva?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.77,1:22:30.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Because of my bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.63,1:22:33.02,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Your bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.45,1:22:35.51,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. My bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.28,1:22:38.63,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,With my father?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.63,1:22:40.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,With everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.91,1:22:44.51,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You're strong, Ayanami.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.04,1:22:48.48,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.18,1:22:52.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.50,1:22:57.15,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.70,1:23:11.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Be aware that, as of now, it has just passed midnight.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.79,1:23:16.83,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.83,1:23:22.14,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, you chose to pilot your Eva.\NIf only for that, I am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.35,1:23:23.21,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.99,1:23:25.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Begin Operation Yashima!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.74,1:23:27.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Begin cannon pre-fire sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.46,1:23:29.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Initiate Stage One power connect.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.28,1:23:33.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger. Switching circuits in primary and secondary substations.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.23,1:23:35.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Deploy all switchers. Begin power connect.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.84,1:23:41.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,All power stations holding at maximum. 0.7 to maximum power threshold.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.28,1:23:43.12,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems in the power supply system.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.34,1:23:46.40,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Increasing frequency modulation capacity to 6.5 million watts.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.40,1:23:48.25,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No irregularities in any of the inverters.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.25,1:23:50.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Stage One circuit breaker system is operating optimally.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.96,1:23:53.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All districts from 1 through 803's power supply circuits are open!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.13,1:23:57.42,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Voltage stable. System frequency maintaining at 50hz.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.83,1:23:59.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Initiate Stage Two power connect.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.60,1:24:02.98,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shingotenba transformer, valve open!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.69,1:24:03.84,eva alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinsusouno transformer, valve open!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.84,1:24:06.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Following that, the Shinyugawara extra transformer will open its valve.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.55,1:24:08.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Voltage modulation within safety range.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.63,1:24:10.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Initiate Stage Three power connect.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.11,1:24:13.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Roger. Routing all power to Futagoyama transformer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.26,1:24:15.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Maintain maximum allowable power transmission strength.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.03,1:24:19.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}All cooling systems running at full capacity.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.65,1:24:21.60,eva alt,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The superconductor energy storage groups are 78.6 percent charged.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.60,1:24:23.64,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Indicator confirms no irregularities.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.26,1:24:24.17,eva alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Flywheel, beginning rotation.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.42,1:24:26.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\an8}Keeping the largest possible amount of energy converted from western Japan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.79,1:24:28.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems detected with third connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.97,1:24:31.54,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood. Inform barricades 4 and 5
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.88,1:24:33.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,to proceed according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.65,1:24:35.74,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Pull back observation aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.24,1:25:07.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No. 3 ground-to-ground system, vaporized!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.33,1:25:09.79,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,All according to plan. Don't pause for even a second! Next!!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.01,1:25:23.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No. 2 Turret Battery has been hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.18,1:25:25.15,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The eighth VLS group has been vaporized!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.15,1:25:27.18,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No. 4 ground-to-ground defense system, initiating attack.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.83,1:25:31.10,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No. 6 Missile Battery, obliterated.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.27,1:25:34.62,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Commencing third wave of laser attack.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.93,1:25:37.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Next, No. 7 Turret Battery will open fire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.36,1:25:40.15,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Positron cannon charging. Currently at one terawatt.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.45,1:25:42.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Maintain condenser fans at 38000 RPM.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.99,1:25:45.11,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Compression density approaching firing threshold.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.11,1:25:47.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Increasing power feed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.45,1:25:48.83,eva alt,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Voltage conversion rate is at 0.019 percent.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.13,1:25:51.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shut down overloaded circuit! Expedite reroute!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.33,1:25:53.08,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Power dropoff is within acceptable range.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.46,1:25:55.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Circuit breakers are operational. Recovery in progress.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.14,1:25:58.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems with the fourth connection.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.19,1:25:59.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Disable final safety device.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.03,1:26:00.96,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Raise firing hammer!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.04,1:26:09.51,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Initiating final input of sniping parameters.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.97,1:26:14.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Adjusting for Earth's rotation and gravity. Plus 0.0009.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.39,1:26:16.85,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Firing mechanism is automatically locking on.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.42,1:26:19.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Scope adjustment complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.33,1:26:23.57,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The photons are accelerating. 0.2 to discharge... 0.1...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.68,1:26:25.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Open the fifth and final connection!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.68,1:26:29.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Route all energy to power discharge subsystem.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.32,1:26:32.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Plugs 1 through 9, ready for power influx.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.31,1:26:35.99,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Proceeding with final calibration of positron acceleration chamber. No problems.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.99,1:26:38.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm not prepared for this like Ayanami is.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.94,1:26:41.69,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And I don't have the confidence to handle my Eva.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.53,1:26:45.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I just do what I'm told, without any reason.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.93,1:26:47.72,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Protect humanity...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.34,1:26:51.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I didn't even realize I was doing such a vital thing...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.84,1:26:53.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}So why does it have to be me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.28,1:26:58.15,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}13, 12, 11...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.15,1:27:02.15,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}10, 9, 8, 7...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.25,1:27:08.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.32,1:27:08.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.46,1:27:30.22,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Did we get it?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.21,1:27:38.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It missed?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.04,1:27:39.44,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible! Was it the timing?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.50,1:27:42.23,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,High-order energy reading detected from target!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.36,1:27:43.94,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,All hands, brace for impact!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.74,1:28:19.31,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the status of the energy system?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.42,1:28:22.75,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It's still usable. We're already recharging!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.75,1:28:24.19,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,And the positron cannon?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.19,1:28:27.14,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Still operational. Barrel cooling now in progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.14,1:28:29.84,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,But unable to verify if another shot is possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.84,1:28:32.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,No need to verify. Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.33,1:28:33.53,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, are you alright?!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.54,1:28:37.60,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry and get Unit 01 back into firing position!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.68,1:28:40.50,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.48,1:28:53.58,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 01's pilot is hereby relieved of duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.00,1:28:56.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll entrust the task of sniping to Unit 00's pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.13,1:28:57.97,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.46,1:29:01.34,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,If he is of no use, we have no choice but to cut him off.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.34,1:29:02.73,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Please hold on!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.34,1:29:05.31,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't run from piloting the Eva.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.20,1:29:09.90,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,He chose not to step down of his own volition. We should entrust this to him!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.32,1:29:13.39,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji, we're counting on you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.39,1:29:15.28,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ikari, do your best!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.49,1:29:34.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Please have some faith in your own son.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.70,1:29:45.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I will place my faith in him as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.62,1:29:51.06,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave it to you. Do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.06,1:29:52.35,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thank you, sir!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.46,1:29:54.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shinji-kun.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.72,1:29:55.49,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.92,1:29:58.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to entrust you with all of Japan's energy...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.37,1:30:02.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,With our future... All humanity's future...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.65,1:30:05.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The future of all living things that have survived...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.65,1:30:07.17,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,They're all in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.75,1:30:09.05,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Try your hardest!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.61,1:30:10.13,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.86,1:30:14.14,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Cannon locked into position.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.14,1:30:15.56,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Readjusting power discharge system.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.56,1:30:17.47,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit 01's G-type equipment has been purged.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.77,1:30:20.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Switching final firing system to manual mode.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.15,1:30:30.65,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Enemy drill tip has breached the ceiling directly above HQ!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.81,1:30:31.98,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ready second shot!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.95,1:30:36.32,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Replacing fuse! Barrel cooling complete!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.53,1:30:39.05,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Power supply system is operating at full capacity.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.05,1:30:41.45,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ground crew evacuation complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.45,1:30:43.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No problems with any of the discharge plugs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.33,1:30:45.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Final sniping specifications data entry complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.81,1:30:48.92,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Any further adjustments will have to be done manually, by the pilot!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.92,1:30:51.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}We'll reach discharge pressure in 0.2!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.63,1:30:54.67,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,High-order energy readings from target again!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.97,1:30:55.51,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.28,1:31:04.93,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.42,1:31:18.24,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.74,1:31:24.67,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The shield won't hold!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.67,1:31:25.41,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,How much longer?!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.54,1:31:26.46,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Only 20 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.29,1:31:28.20,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.20,1:31:38.09,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on... Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.12,1:31:41.89,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.99,1:32:14.75,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.73,1:32:46.66,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.61,1:32:52.98,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.56,1:33:26.87,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.98,1:33:27.81,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.81,1:33:29.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami?! Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.40,1:33:44.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say things like, "I have nothing else".
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.38,1:33:51.86,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say sad things like "farewell," as if we'll never meet again...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.41,1:34:03.03,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.24,1:34:07.37,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.73,1:34:11.33,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what kind of expression I should have at a time like this...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.67,1:34:14.71,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be best if you smiled, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.48,1:34:59.04,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me guess-- The boy has awakened. Now we enter the general phase of the plan, yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.95,1:35:04.76,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,That's correct. The Dead Sea Scroll Apocrypha have been fulfilled up to the Books of law.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.28,1:35:07.55,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,The promised time draws near.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.59,1:35:13.70,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,Not the Third again...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.70,1:35:15.52,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,You never change, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.86,1:35:20.61,eva,,0000,0000,0000,,I look foward to meeting you, Ikari Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.65,1:35:23.36,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnSoutane\be1\bord0.5\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1016,516)}TO BE CONTINUED
